{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SeJK7xdcqniz2hABppRfRi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Workflow State Machine — Panel-Ops\n2\t\n3\t**Version:** 1.0. Server-enforced. Matrix stored as JSON in `Configuration.transition_matrix`\n4\t(versioned); this document is the human-readable source the JSON is generated from.\n5\t\n6\t## States\n7\t\n8\t| # | ID | English | Español | Category | Aging-critical (internal 1h) |\n9\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n10\t| 1 | `received` | Request received | Solicitud recibida | intake | yes |\n11\t| 2 | `incomplete` | Incomplete information | Información incompleta | intake | no (waiting on customer) |\n12\t| 3 | `review` | Under review | En revisión | intake | yes |\n13\t| 4 | `awaiting_confirmation` | Awaiting customer confirmation | Esperando confirmación cliente | intake | no |\n14\t| 5 | `confirmed` | Data confirmed | Datos confirmados | commercial | yes |\n15\t| 6 | `quoting` | Quotation in preparation | Cotización en preparación | commercial | yes |\n16\t| 7 | `quote_sent` | Quotation sent | Cotización enviada | commercial | no |\n17\t| 8 | `awaiting_approval` | Awaiting approval | Esperando aprobación | commercial | no |\n18\t| 9 | `approved_unpaid` | Approved — awaiting payment | Aprobada — esperando pago | payment | no |\n19\t| 10 | `payment_verifying` | Payment under verification | Pago en verificación | payment | yes |\n20\t| 11 | `payment_confirmed` | Payment confirmed | Pago confirmado | payment | yes |\n21\t| 12 | `ready_production` | Ready for production | Lista para producción | production | yes |\n22\t| 13 | `in_production` | In production | En producción | production | no |\n23\t| 14 | `ready_delivery` | Ready for delivery | Lista para entrega | production | yes |\n24\t| 15 | `delivered` | Delivered | Entregada | production | no |\n25\t| 16 | `closed` | Closed | Cerrada | closed (terminal) | — |\n26\t| 17 | `lost` | Lost / cancelled | Perdida / cancelada | closed (terminal) | — |\n27\t\n28\t## Transition Matrix\n29\t\n30\tLegend: S=sales, M=management, B=billing, SYS=system. `lost` reachable from every\n31\tnon-terminal state (S or M, `loss_reason` required). `M` may additionally reopen: `closed→review`, `lost→review` (exception, Activity note required).\n32\t\n33\t| From \\ To | allowed |\n34\t|---|---|\n35\t| `received` | `incomplete` (S) · `review` (S) |\n36\t| `incomplete` | `review` (S) |\n37\t| `review` | `incomplete` (S) · `awaiting_confirmation` (S) · `confirmed` (S) |\n38\t| `awaiting_confirmation` | `review` (S) · `confirmed` (S, confirmation evidence required) |\n39\t| `confirmed` | `quoting` (S) |\n40\t| `quoting` | `quote_sent` (S, quotation version required) |\n41\t| `quote_sent` | `awaiting_approval` (S) · `quoting` (S, new version) |\n42\t| `awaiting_approval` | `approved_unpaid` (S, decision=approved) · `quoting` (S, changes_requested) |\n43\t| `approved_unpaid` | `payment_verifying` (S or B, payment registered) |\n44\t| `payment_verifying` | `payment_confirmed` (**B only**) · `approved_unpaid` (B, payment rejected) |\n45\t| `payment_confirmed` | `ready_production` (SYS/S — automatic after commercial snapshot locked) |\n46\t| `ready_production` | `in_production` (S) |\n47\t| `in_production` | `ready_delivery` (S) |\n48\t| `ready_delivery` | `delivered` (S, delivery evidence) |\n49\t| `delivered` | `closed` (S or M) |\n50\t\n51\t## Guards (server-side, in addition to role)\n52\t\n53\t1. `awaiting_confirmation → confirmed`: at least 1 part row, all required part fields valid, confirmation evidence document attached OR Activity note with evidence reference.\n54\t2. `quoting → quote_sent`: quotation version exists with full price snapshot; PDF generated.\n55\t3. `awaiting_approval → approved_unpaid`: decision recorded on active quotation version.\n56\t4. `approved_unpaid → payment_verifying`: Payment row exists (status=registered/verifying).\n57\t5. `payment_verifying → payment_confirmed`: actor role = billing; payment evidence attached; amount recorded.\n58\t6. `payment_confirmed → ready_production`: commercial snapshot frozen (`Quotations.immutable=true`), technical package generable. **No other path into ready_production exists.**\n59\t7. Quotation expiry: SYS marks quotation `expired` after `valid_until`; ticket stays in place, label `price update required` added; re-quote required before approval.\n60\t8. Any transition writes Activity row; invalid transition returns explicit error listing allowed targets.\n61\t\n62\t## Aging Rule\n63\t\n64\tAlert when `now - last_activity_at > 60 min` AND state is aging-critical AND `waiting_on=internal`.\n65\tCards always show: stage age, total age, owner, next action, blocking reason, customer-waiting flag, severity.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bfaf515c-a027-44c3-87b0-f5ccc9482619","uuid":"bd80d3db-5f74-401a-908a-9cbd9f06a6d1","timestamp":"2026-07-18T03:35:47.995Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/work945/Documents/Proyectos/ABM/proyectos/panel-ops/workflow-state-machine.md","content":"# Workflow State Machine — Panel-Ops\n\n**Version:** 1.0. Server-enforced. Matrix stored as JSON in `Configuration.transition_matrix`\n(versioned); this document is the human-readable source the JSON is generated from.\n\n## States\n\n| # | ID | English | Español | Category | Aging-critical (internal 1h) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `received` | Request received | Solicitud recibida | intake | yes |\n| 2 | `incomplete` | Incomplete information | Información incompleta | intake | no (waiting on customer) |\n| 3 | `review` | Under review | En revisión | intake | yes |\n| 4 | `awaiting_confirmation` | Awaiting customer confirmation | Esperando confirmación cliente | intake | no |\n| 5 | `confirmed` | Data confirmed | Datos confirmados | commercial | yes |\n| 6 | `quoting` | Quotation in preparation | Cotización en preparación | commercial | yes |\n| 7 | `quote_sent` | Quotation sent | Cotización enviada | commercial | no |\n| 8 | `awaiting_approval` | Awaiting approval | Esperando aprobación | commercial | no |\n| 9 | `approved_unpaid` | Approved — awaiting payment | Aprobada — esperando pago | payment | no |\n| 10 | `payment_verifying` | Payment under verification | Pago en verificación | payment | yes |\n| 11 | `payment_confirmed` | Payment confirmed | Pago confirmado | payment | yes |\n| 12 | `ready_production` | Ready for production | Lista para producción | production | yes |\n| 13 | `in_production` | In production | En producción | production | no |\n| 14 | `ready_delivery` | Ready for delivery | Lista para entrega | production | yes |\n| 15 | `delivered` | Delivered | Entregada | production | no |\n| 16 | `closed` | Closed | Cerrada | closed (terminal) | — |\n| 17 | `lost` | Lost / cancelled | Perdida / cancelada | closed (terminal) | — |\n\n## Transition Matrix\n\nLegend: S=sales, M=management, B=billing, SYS=system. `lost` reachable from every\nnon-terminal state (S or M, `loss_reason` required). `M` may additionally reopen: `closed→review`, `lost→review` (exception, Activity note required).\n\n| From \\ To | allowed |\n|---|---|\n| `received` | `incomplete` (S) · `review` (S) |\n| `incomplete` | `review` (S) |\n| `review` | `incomplete` (S) · `awaiting_confirmation` (S) · `confirmed` (S) |\n| `awaiting_confirmation` | `review` (S) · `confirmed` (S, confirmation evidence required) |\n| `confirmed` | `quoting` (S) |\n| `quoting` | `quote_sent` (S, quotation version required) |\n| `quote_sent` | `awaiting_approval` (S) · `quoting` (S, new version) |\n| `awaiting_approval` | `approved_unpaid` (S, decision=approved) · `quoting` (S, changes_requested) |\n| `approved_unpaid` | `payment_verifying` (S or B, payment registered) |\n| `payment_verifying` | `payment_confirmed` (**B only**) · `approved_unpaid` (B, payment rejected) |\n| `payment_confirmed` | `ready_production` (SYS/S — automatic after commercial snapshot locked) |\n| `ready_production` | `in_production` (S) |\n| `in_production` | `ready_delivery` (S) |\n| `ready_delivery` | `delivered` (S, delivery evidence) |\n| `delivered` | `closed` (S or M) |\n\n## Guards (server-side, in addition to role)\n\n1. `awaiting_confirmation → confirmed`: at least 1 part row, all required part fields valid, confirmation evidence document attached OR Activity note with evidence reference.\n2. `quoting → quote_sent`: quotation version exists with full price snapshot; PDF generated.\n3. `awaiting_approval → approved_unpaid`: decision recorded on active quotation version.\n4. `approved_unpaid → payment_verifying`: Payment row exists (status=registered/verifying).\n5. `payment_verifying → payment_confirmed`: actor role = billing; payment evidence attached; amount recorded.\n6. `payment_confirmed → ready_production`: commercial snapshot frozen (`Quotations.immutable=true`), technical package generable. **No other path into ready_production exists.**\n7. Quotation expiry: SYS marks quotation `expired` after `valid_until`; ticket stays in place, label `price update required` added; re-quote required before approval.\n8. Any transition writes Activity row; invalid transition returns explicit error listing allowed targets.\n\n## Aging Rule\n\nAlert when `now - last_activity_at > 60 min` AND state is aging-critical AND `waiting_on=internal`.\nCards always show: stage age, total age, owner, next action, blocking reason, customer-waiting flag, severity.\n","numLines":66,"startLine":1,"totalLines":66}}}
