{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019JbqtmSC79M6tRHh6JjjKq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Acceptance Strategy — Panel-Ops\n2\t\n3\t**Version:** 1.0\n4\t\n5\t## Principles\n6\t\n7\t1. No ticket is \"complete\" without executor evidence: `roadmap-status.md` entry + log file + completion comment in `comments/<TICKET>.jsonl`. Source files existing ≠ done.\n8\t2. Architect reviews evidence against ticket acceptance criteria + invariants, then accepts, rejects, or issues a corrective ticket (`FIX-*`). Architect never fixes code.\n9\t3. Each phase closes with a validation gate using **real orders** before the next phase's build tickets start.\n10\t\n11\t## Evidence per ticket type\n12\t\n13\t| Type | Required evidence |\n14\t|---|---|\n15\t| Apps Script / backend | Verification commands output in log; manual test script results; no edits outside \"files allowed to change\" |\n16\t| UI | Screenshot or described walkthrough in completion comment; role-based visibility verified |\n17\t| Data schema | Sheet tabs + headers match `data-model.md` exactly; seed rows present |\n18\t| Governance (GOV-001) | All 13 acceptance criteria demonstrated; `roadmap.md` byte-identical before/after |\n19\t| Adapters | Round-trip test with real sample file (blocked until DIS-001 delivers) |\n20\t\n21\t## Phase gates\n22\t\n23\t- **Gate 0 → 1:** discovery inputs collected or explicitly deferred with M sign-off; GOV-001 operational.\n24\t- **Gate 1 → 2:** 10 representative real orders driven through intake→Kanban by actual users; state machine and aging verified; company stops handwritten tracking for new orders.\n25\t- **Gate 2 → 3:** 5 real quotations generated and compared against manually calculated quotations; price snapshot verified reproducible.\n26\t- **Gate 3 → 4:** full cycle intake→payment confirmed→ready_production on real orders; billing-only confirmation verified; paid snapshot immutability attack-tested (attempt edits, expect rejection).\n27\t- **Gate 4 → 5:** LEPTON + KDT files accepted by the real machines/software.\n28\t\n29\t## MVP acceptance (master doc §25)\n30\t\n31\tAll 19 criteria, executed by the real users on production Google Workspace, witnessed\n32\tand recorded in Activity + a signed-off checklist stored in `03_REPORTS`.\n33\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bfaf515c-a027-44c3-87b0-f5ccc9482619","uuid":"6512258d-1d6a-4520-a47e-3ed3c1c11a8e","timestamp":"2026-07-18T03:36:20.919Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/work945/Documents/Proyectos/ABM/proyectos/panel-ops/acceptance-strategy.md","content":"# Acceptance Strategy — Panel-Ops\n\n**Version:** 1.0\n\n## Principles\n\n1. No ticket is \"complete\" without executor evidence: `roadmap-status.md` entry + log file + completion comment in `comments/<TICKET>.jsonl`. Source files existing ≠ done.\n2. Architect reviews evidence against ticket acceptance criteria + invariants, then accepts, rejects, or issues a corrective ticket (`FIX-*`). Architect never fixes code.\n3. Each phase closes with a validation gate using **real orders** before the next phase's build tickets start.\n\n## Evidence per ticket type\n\n| Type | Required evidence |\n|---|---|\n| Apps Script / backend | Verification commands output in log; manual test script results; no edits outside \"files allowed to change\" |\n| UI | Screenshot or described walkthrough in completion comment; role-based visibility verified |\n| Data schema | Sheet tabs + headers match `data-model.md` exactly; seed rows present |\n| Governance (GOV-001) | All 13 acceptance criteria demonstrated; `roadmap.md` byte-identical before/after |\n| Adapters | Round-trip test with real sample file (blocked until DIS-001 delivers) |\n\n## Phase gates\n\n- **Gate 0 → 1:** discovery inputs collected or explicitly deferred with M sign-off; GOV-001 operational.\n- **Gate 1 → 2:** 10 representative real orders driven through intake→Kanban by actual users; state machine and aging verified; company stops handwritten tracking for new orders.\n- **Gate 2 → 3:** 5 real quotations generated and compared against manually calculated quotations; price snapshot verified reproducible.\n- **Gate 3 → 4:** full cycle intake→payment confirmed→ready_production on real orders; billing-only confirmation verified; paid snapshot immutability attack-tested (attempt edits, expect rejection).\n- **Gate 4 → 5:** LEPTON + KDT files accepted by the real machines/software.\n\n## MVP acceptance (master doc §25)\n\nAll 19 criteria, executed by the real users on production Google Workspace, witnessed\nand recorded in Activity + a signed-off checklist stored in `03_REPORTS`.\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}}}
